# No AI co-contributors

Never add Cursor Agent (or any AI) as a git co-contributor.

Forbidden in commit messages, PR bodies, and code comments:
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`
- `Co-authored-by: Claude` / `noreply@anthropic.com`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- Any other AI / agent attribution trailer

Do not pass `--trailer` for AI tools. If the environment injects a trailer, strip it before pushing.
Commits and PRs must be authored only as Adam / MarkockiAdam.
